{"id":"CVE-2019-16935","state":"PUBLISHED","assigner":"mitre","published":"2019-09-28T01:33:02.000Z","updated":"2026-10-07T18:18:30.322Z","description":"The documentation XML-RPC server in Python through 2.7.16, 3.x through 3.6.9, and 3.7.x through 3.7.4 has XSS via the server_title field. This occurs in Lib/DocXMLRPCServer.py in Python 2.x, and in Lib/xmlrpc/server.py in Python 3.x. If set_server_title is called with untrusted input, arbitrary JavaScript can be delivered to clients that visit the http URL for this server.","cwe":["n/a","CWE-79 CWE-79 Improper Neutralization of Input During Web Page Generation ('Cross-site Scripting')"],"metrics":[{"src":"CISA-ADP","v":"3.1","score":6.1,"sev":"MEDIUM","vector":"CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:R/S:C/C:L/I:L/A:N"},{"src":"CISA-ADP","ssvc":{"Exploitation":"none","Automatable":"no","Technical Impact":"partial"}}],"affected":[{"vendor":"n/a","product":"n/a","versions":["affected n/a"]}],"references":[{"url":"https://usn.ubuntu.com/4151-1/","tags":["vendor-advisory","x_refsource_UBUNTU"],"name":"USN-4151-1"},{"url":"https://usn.ubuntu.com/4151-2/","tags":["vendor-advisory","x_refsource_UBUNTU"],"name":"USN-4151-2"},{"url":"http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2019-10/msg00062.html","tags":["vendor-advisory","x_refsource_SUSE"],"name":"openSUSE-SU-2019:2389"},{"url":"http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2019-10/msg00063.html","tags":["vendor-advisory","x_refsource_SUSE"],"name":"openSUSE-SU-2019:2393"},{"url":"http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2019-11/msg00012.html","tags":["vendor-advisory","x_refsource_SUSE"],"name":"openSUSE-SU-2019:2438"},{"url":"http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2019-11/msg00021.html","tags":["vendor-advisory","x_refsource_SUSE"],"name":"openSUSE-SU-2019:2453"},{"url":"https://lists.fedoraproject.org/archives/list/package-announce%40lists.fedoraproject.org/message/K7HNVIFMETMFWWWUNTB72KYJYXCZOS5V/","tags":["vendor-advisory","x_refsource_